Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: fix early DSI PLL power and
 cleanup

Add kernel patches 0077-0078. Advance to release 72.

Signed-off-by: Roman Kuraev <naoru.desu@gmail.com>
